<messaging:emailTemplate subject="Modon Has Approved Your Expression of Interest {!relatedTo.EOIId__c}" recipientType="Contact"  relatedToType="Expressionofinterest__c">
<messaging:plainTextEmailBody >
Dear {!recipient.Name},

Thank you for your recent submission of your expression of interest {!relatedTo.EOIId__c} to Modon has been accepted.

The sales consultant assigned to you, will be in touch soon with the next steps.

Thank you once again for your interest in Modon.

Warm regards,
Modon Sales Team
</messaging:plainTextEmailBody>
</messaging:emailTemplate>